ICNS
==============

This is a placeholder file. For macOS support, you need to generate a proper .icns file.

To generate a .icns file:

1. Use ImageMagick:
   convert icon.png -resize 16x16 icon_16.png
   convert icon.png -resize 32x32 icon_32.png
   convert icon.png -resize 64x64 icon_64.png
   convert icon.png -resize 128x128 icon_128.png
   convert icon.png -resize 256x256 icon_256.png
   convert icon.png -resize 512x512 icon_512.png
   iconutil -c icns -o icon.icns icon_*.png

2. Or use online tools:
   - https://iconverticons.com/convert/
   - https://icoconvert.com/

Replace this file with the generated .icns file.
